{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_only\": [\n    \"悲伤不是哭出来的，而是一种失重、恍惚、胸口发紧却没有眼泪的麻木感。\",\n    \"当痛苦超过承受限度时，感知仿佛自动关闭，人暂时抽离现实，躲进一段不真实的安宁里。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_only\": [\n    \"明明想安慰自己“没关系，都过去了”，却发现安慰不起作用，反而越想越烦躁，越走越急，思绪逐渐失控。\",\n    \"回忆带来的感受是双重的：一边觉得温暖、被安慰，一边又因为触碰到失去的东西而感到一阵阵刺痛。\",\n    \"情绪爆发过后，兴奋和激动突然退潮，身体像透支了一样，刚才的狂热甚至恍如一场高烧中的幻觉，留下空落感。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更胜一筹，因为它把情绪落实成普通人熟悉的心理活动和身体反应：自我安慰失败、越走越急、膝盖发软却强撑、被安慰又被刺痛、激动退潮后的空落。这些体验有明确的触发过程和细腻的情绪变化，听众更容易在自己身上找到对应感受。X虽然有少数很好的细微感受，但大量篇幅依赖濒死叙事、抽象心理概念和宏大比喻，容易让听众理解作者的故事，却不一定能辨认自己的感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4c5cfb5a-739b-418d-8b21-9762b33b64fb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T182915903791Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:29:40.192331+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1356fd9fa9703da6389ffa5f9ff1c385ccfb4fcbdbb6c09caa57ee804e10bf6d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions